[
{ type: upgrade
  message: <<EOM
acme-dns 2.0 replaced the cgo SQLite driver with a pure Go one, which
registers under the name "sqlite".  If your acme-dns config.cfg contains

  engine = "sqlite3"

change it to

  engine = "sqlite"

before restarting acme_dns; with the old value acme-dns 2.0 logs
'sql: unknown driver "sqlite3"' and cannot use the database.  Existing
database files can be kept as they are.

Compare your config.cfg with config.cfg.sample for other changed
defaults (for example logformat is now "json").
EOM
}
